  "description": "Analyze API (Beta): Use the Analyze API to analyze any external asset and return details based on the type of analysis requested.<br /><br />\nCurrently supports the following analysis options:<br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_vision_addon#tagging_mode\">AI Vision - Tagging</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_vision_addon#moderation_mode\">AI Vision - Moderation</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_vision_addon#general_mode\">AI Vision - General</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#ai_based_image_captioning\">Captioning</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Cld Fashion</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Cld Text</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Coco</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/google_auto_tagging_addon\">Google Tagging</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Human Anatomy</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#image_quality_analysis\">Image Quality Analysis</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Lvis</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Shop Classifier</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#supported_content_aware_detection_models\">Unidet</a><br />\n  * <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_ai_content_analysis_addon#watermark_detection\">Watermark Detection</a><br /><br />\n  **Notes**: <br />\n  * The Analyze API is currently in development and is available as a Public Beta, which means we value your feedback, so please feel free to <a href=\"https://support.cloudinary.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\">share any thoughts with us</a>.<br />\n  * The analysis options require an active subscription to the relevant add-on. Learn more about <a href=\"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_add_ons#registering_for_add_ons\">registering for add-ons</a>.<br /><br />\n  The API supports both Basic Authentication using your Cloudinary API Key and API Secret (which can be found on the Dashboard page of your <a href=\"https://console.cloudinary.com/pm\">Cloudinary Console</a>) or OAuth2 (<a href=\"https://support.cloudinary.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\">Contact support</a> for more information regarding OAuth).<br />",
